{"request":{"method":"GET","url":"https://api.mangaupdates.com/v1/series/72274276213","body":""},"status":200,"headers":{"Content-Type":"application/json"},"json":{"series_id":72274276213,"title":"Monster","url":"https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/x7a8kfp/monster","associated":[{"title":"Monsutaa"},{"title":"Naoki Urasawa's Monster"},{"title":"Монстр"},{"title":"मॉन्स्टर"},{"title":"मोंस्टर"},{"title":"คนปีศาจ"},{"title":"モンスター"},{"title":"怪物"},{"title":"몬스터"}],"description":"From Viz:  \nEveryone faces uncertainty at some point in their lives. Even a brilliant surgeon like Kenzo Tenma is no exception. But there’s no way he could have known that his decision to stop chasing professional success and instead concentrate on his oath to save peoples’ lives would result in the birth of an abomination. The questions of good and evil now take on a terrifyingly real dimension. Years later, in Germany during the tumultuous post-reunification period, middle-aged childless couples are being killed one after another. The serial killer’s identity is known. The reasons why he kills are not. Dr. Tenma sets out on a journey to find the killer’s twin sister, who may hold some clues to solving the enigma of the “Monster.”\n\n\n[Official English](https://www.viz.com/manga-books/monster/section/128962/more)\n\nNote: Won the 46th Shogakukan Manga Award in the general category.\n\n","image":{"url":{"original":"https://cdn.mangaupdates.com/image/i216517.png","thumb":"https://cdn.mangaupdates.com/image/thumb/i216517.png"},"height":229,"width":160},"type":"Manga","year":"1994","bayesian_rating":8.76,"rating_votes":2033,"genres":[{"genre":"Drama"},{"genre":"Horror"},{"genre":"Mature"},{"genre":"Mystery"},{"genre":"Psychological"},{"genre":"Seinen"},{"genre":"Tragedy"}],"categories":[{"series_id":72274276213,"category":"20th Century","votes":13,"votes_plus":13,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":2095673730},{"series_id":72274276213,"category":"Abusive Sibling/s","votes":1,"votes_plus":0,"votes_minus"